      "value": "This is a real grab bag of ideas, but I do agree with many of them, so it's worth a vote and consideration.\n\nThe part about \"special effects\" avatars is one personal to me. Exactly as you say, I've always had to rely on naughty bypass methods or weird workarounds to create fun effects. I don't like having to resort to this, and it makes it more difficult to share what you've learned due to not wanting to pass it onto someone who will be irresponsible with it.\n\nLately the changes to audio have destroyed several of my previous \"show\" avatars. The changes overall are great and suit general purpose use just fine in a reasonable way, but the way it removed certain past exploits has unfortunately hit more than just the ear-rape spammers. If people had the freedom to opt into boosted audio settings or removing other limits, or perhaps grant specific permission to an individual, it would largely solve the issues that \"showcase avatars\" have been hampered by.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
